{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1041046-the-cr-amp-and-vr-amp-a-series-of-devices-for-technocrats-and-etherites","id":1041046,"title":"The CR-AMP, and VR-AMP, a series of devices for Technocrats and Etherites.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-30T19:00:15-08:00","id":1041046,"title":"The CR-AMP, and VR-AMP, a series of devices for Technocrats and Etherites.","content":"Not every blueprint that comes out of Q-division is destined for great things, and among these footnotes of abandoned research and prototypes, the Orion Project is one that has long since been whispered about amongst those with an eye towards science geared towards blowing things up. Aside from the remarkable thrust properties of the Orion drive itself, the project also produced an idea for a weapon based upon restraining the blast of a nuclear explosive and funneling it along a pre-determined route.<br /> <br /> While initial designs proved devastatingly effective, the weapon simply wasn't worth the cost. Atomic materials are rare, and difficult to synthesize in amounts great enough to render practical to use in the field. And while shock and awe is occasionally needed, the Unions job is generally speaking, to <i>prevent</i> giant spears of fire coming down from the heavens. Not cause them. And so the design fell out of favor with control and was shelved.<br /> <br /> Of course, fate has a way of bringing such things to the surface. In this case fate was a local group of the Etherite cabal known as the &quot;Manhattans.&quot; who following a raid on a Technocratic data center couldn't help but be inspired by the design. Until they struck on the idea of substituting the hardened barrel of the weapon with a correspondence chamber, and the exploding nuke with a dollop of antimatter.<br /> <br /> And thus was the Correspondence Restrained AntiMatter Projector born. The weapon relies upon a correspondence effect to create an inviolable space in the center of the weapon, channeling all the exploding force of the blast out of the portal created by the 'barrel' of the gun. A single dollop of antimatter can create a destructive shock wave 100 yards long, dealing significant damage to all those caught within. Milton Berliner's personal copy of the weapon even included an 'anti-matter pump' a device that created the complex material on an as-needed basis, though less skilled members of the gang had to make do with loading what they could create in their spare time, if they could manage the feats of awakened Ethertech required to build and operate one of the devices at all.<br /> <br /> Taking the theft of technocratic weapons designs somewhat personally, the weapon smiths of Iteration X converged to create a response. Noting that the Etherites version was a tad.... unsubtle. The Manhattans being a gang of nihilistic gun-nuts. The Iterators crafted a version with a series of alternate channels for the gun that could be swapped through to change the length of the projection. Though still capable of the long-ranged devastation of the CR-AMP, the Variable Range AntiMatter Projector as the Clockwork Convention came to call it was also capable of funneling the blast to much shorter ranges, allowing usage of the device indoors.<br /> <br /> And, because any treatise on a weapon used by technocrats would not be complete with tips on how to defeat it... the weapon works by channeling air from the environment through a portal into a firing chamber in a subspace inside the weapon. By taking away that air, the gun will have nothing to react with and thus foiling the firing mechanism. Though for those guns that have an antimatter pump, such a maneuver could have catastrophic consequences as the wielder pulls the trigger again and again, building up antimatter in the subspace until it leaks out...<br /> <br /> In addition, while efficient, devices of this kind are generally more susceptible to countermagic than their effects would imply.<br /> <br /> (And now for the crunch. This is a weapon I've been thinking about for a while, and I hope my little story didn't bore you too badly. In essence, the weapon comes in three forms. You have the two variants of the CR-AMP, both require correspondence 4 to create the firing chamber and the barrel and forces 2 for the safety switch on the antimatter. However, if you want the weapon itself to generate the antimatter it uses, it also requires Matter 5. The first variant is a 5 point wonder, and the latter is a 7 point wonder, it requires a successful arete roll on the part of the wielder to fire or disengage the safety and is quite clearly vulgar as all hell. The VR-Amp on the other hand functions on much the same as the enhanced CR-AMP with an added perk, by making an arete roll, the wielder can adjust the range of the blast wave allowing the wielder to avoid collateral damage an effect accomplished by way of lengthy correspondence barrels.)<br /> <br /> Standard for the weapon is 3 dice of unsoakable agg. As per 1 dollop of antimatter. However if some fool wants to push it, they could try for more. Personally I would rule it requires energy weapons to wield effectively, but I could see the argument being made for heavy weapons.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Something I forgot to mention. Versions WITHOUT Matter 5 will require some external source of anti-matter ammunition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11744,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","user":"Enginseer-42","date":". 01-30-2017, 10:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-30T19:57:55-08:00","id":1041066,"title":"","content":"Cazador, Rad-Scorpions, Octopodes (Life 2).<br /> <br /> Those little babies I made for an Etherite of mine. I was looking at Life 2, thinking how to make better use of that. So, I came up to those.<br /> <br /> Cazador are gaint bees, and Rad Scorpions giant Scorpions (dah)... If anyone ever played Fallout will know them.<br /> <br /> Octopodes are... My little personal touch. They are... Octopus... With several changes to allow for breathing and walking inland.<br /> <br /> Those obviously vulgar things can only be made on Vat tanks, s\u00f3 you'll need a serious lab for that. After growing your pets, pherormones are used to mark targets and non-targets (basically, an Life 1 connected on them). The octopodes inky is replaced with acid, and they are little devils when swarming an enemy at the hundreds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12880-karlgust","name":"Karlgust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"614"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-30T20:34:42-08:00","id":1041087,"title":"","content":"After I created the Octopodes, a friend of mine, who also loves the Etherite and loved the idea of those little creeps, so, the Octopobazooka was born.<br /> <br /> <b>Octopobazooka</b> - Octopus are fascinating creatures; even more fascinating is that their simple structures are easy to manipulate. With an well equiped lab and some Vat Tanks, they can be grown in just a few hours. Mechanical medical braces are a must have within the Vats, because many of the procedures need cirurgical intervention, but you can programe several braces to operate simultaneously, so you can safely breed some dozens every hour or so.<br /> <br /> First, you need to connect their stomachs with several key arteries of the heart; the stomach will be their new &quot;lungs&quot;. Some modifications in the muscles will provide the necessary ventilation (you'll find the exact incision points on the appendix manual; if you're familiar with programming in java, the arquivo contains the files to make those automatic by the medical robotic braces of the Vat Tank, youll need only to supervise). Next, an infusion of hormones and nutrients in the tank will \u00edndice the necessary muscular changes to allow them to walk in land (and they do walk REALLY fast). An injection in their months of chemicals derived from turtles DNA will induce the local production of Cheratine, strenghtening their bites to make them capable of chewing steel. Also, this will produce several claws along their tentacles, allow them to cut flesh like butter (always try to throw them at your enemies faces, for maximum damage)<br /> <br /> Next, it comes the inky sack.While changing the stomachs, an sterilization of the acid producing cells is needed, and that first lay of stomachal skin must be carefully removed and transplanted into the only sac. After that, they'll drop acid on enemies. It can use the claws of his tentacles, the strong bite and the acid to attack.<br /> <br /> This little monster than is made to segregate an chitinous membrane, that makes the creature to be enveloped in a big egg, were it will be storaged for later use.<br /> <br /> The Octopobazooka is a simple device. Mount it on the back od a truck for use. This equipment is simply a kind of catapult to launch the Octopodes. It has a cadence of 1 shoot/round.<br /> <br /> Upon the impact, the egg breaks, and the Octopus inside will Hunt for its enemies.<br /> <br /> Those creatures have a short live span, and turn into a pool of acid upo death","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12880-karlgust","name":"Karlgust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"614"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}